# seed 3 force_calls 119079 total_searches 104 repeats 21 rate 22704775.4 rate_accuracy 0 catalogue_accuracy 0.4471074965 confidence 0.9523809524 reached 1
# counter harness. Each seed is an independent catalogue on the minimized reactant.
# Prefactor 1e+12 is the eOn AKMC default_value. Temperature is the problem value.
# Old-scheme confidence is 1 - 1/repeats. Process identity is the top-window RMSD test plus a 0.05 eV barrier gate.
# rate_accuracy is max(0, 1 - abs(rate - reference) / reference). It is 0 when the catalogue rate is at least twice the reference. The mean catalogue rate is 24.2713 times that reference.
# The reference is the parallel-replica Langevin escape rate. The catalogue rate is the HTST sum over the AKMC processes. The aladatom campaign branch is not on origin.
# pyKMC uses the r2549 Aluminum EAM through the harness. The eOn AKMC row uses the client's built-in eam_al and a client counter.
code pykmc
